name: ['Accursed Horde', 'Akoum Hellkite', 'Aven Wind Mage', 'Brute Strength', 'Calculating Lich', 'Carrion Screecher', 'Claustrophobia', "Consul's Lieutenant", 'Crested Herdcaller', 'Crow of Dark Tidings', 'Cryptic Serpent', 'Decision Paralysis', 'Destructive Tampering', 'Dragon Egg', 'Dramatic Reversal', 'Earthshaker Giant', 'Engulf the Shore', 'Fiend Binder', 'Fiendish Duo', 'Forest', 'Galestrike', 'Gavony Unhallowed', 'Ghalta, Primal Hunger', 'Grasp of Darkness', 'Grazing Whiptail', 'Highcliff Felidar', 'Howling Golem', 'Island', 'Kargan Dragonrider', "Kytheon's Irregulars", 'Lathliss, Dragon Queen', 'Lightning Strike', "Liliana's Mastery", 'Lord of the Accursed', 'Mighty Leap', 'Mountain', 'Patron of the Valiant', 'Plains', 'Ranging Raptors', 'Relief Captain', 'Ripjaw Raptor', 'Rise from the Grave', 'Rise from the Tides', "River's Rebuke", 'Salvager of Secrets', 'Sparktongue Dragon', 'Sphinx of Enlightenment', 'Spidery Grasp', 'Steppe Glider', 'Swamp', 'Take Vengeance', 'Tattered Mummy', 'Thunderherd Migration', 'Thundering Spineback', 'Topan Freeblade', 'Torgaar, Famine Incarnate', 'Voldaren Duelist', 'Zealot of the God-Pharaoh', 'Zetalpa, Primal Dawn']
