text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, reveal a Dinosaur card from your hand or pay {1}.\\nSearch your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This spell costs {2} less to cast for each creature sacrificed this way.\\nWhen Torgaar, Famine Incarnate enters the battlefield, up to one target player's life total becomes half their starting life total, rounded down.", "As long as you control a Dragon, Kargan Dragonrider has flying. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "Choose one —\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Creatures without flying can't block this turn.", 'Create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.', 'Defender\\nWhen Dragon Egg dies, create a 2/2 red Dragon creature token with flying and "{R}: This creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', 'Destroy target tapped creature.', "Enchant creature\\nWhen Claustrophobia enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Enrage — Whenever Ranging Raptors is dealt damage, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Enrage — Whenever Ripjaw Raptor is dealt damage, draw a card.', 'First strike\\nIf a source would deal damage to an opponent, it deals double that damage to that player instead.', "First strike\\nRenown 1 (When this creature deals combat damage to a player, if it isn't renowned, put a +1/+1 counter on it and it becomes renowned.)\\nWhenever Consul's Lieutenant attacks, if it's renowned, other attacking creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.", 'Flying', 'Flying, double strike, vigilance, trample, indestructible', 'Flying, vigilance\\n{1}{W}: Target creature with a +1/+1 counter on it gains flying and vigilance until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Akoum Hellkite deals 1 damage to any target. If that land is a Mountain, Akoum Hellkite deals 2 damage instead.', 'Flying\\nWhen Crow of Dark Tidings enters the battlefield or dies, mill two cards. (Put the top two cards of your library into your graveyard.)', 'Flying\\nWhen Patron of the Valiant enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sparktongue Dragon enters the battlefield, you may pay {2}{R}. When you do, it deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sphinx of Enlightenment enters the battlefield, target opponent draws a card and you draw three cards.', 'Flying\\nWhenever another nontoken Dragon enters the battlefield under your control, create a 5/5 red Dragon creature token with flying.\\n{1}{R}: Dragons you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Aven Wind Mage gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Haste\\nWhen Voldaren Duelist enters the battlefield, target creature can't block this turn.", 'Lightning Strike deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Menace\\nWhenever a creature attacks one of your opponents, that player loses 1 life.', 'Other Dinosaurs you control get +1/+1.\\n{5}{G}: Create a 3/3 green Dinosaur creature token with trample.', 'Other Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: All Zombies gain menace until end of turn.', 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. That creature is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types.', 'Reach', "Renown 1 (When this creature deals combat damage to a player, if it isn't renowned, put a +1/+1 counter on it and it becomes renowned.)\\n{W}{W}: Tap target creature.", "Return all nonland permanents target player controls to their owner's hand.", "Return target tapped creature to its owner's hand.\\nDraw a card.", "Return to their owners' hands all creatures with toughness less than or equal to the number of Islands you control.", "Tap up to two target creatures. Those creatures don't untap during their controller's next untap step.", 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.', 'This spell costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.', 'This spell costs {X} less to cast, where X is the total power of creatures you control.\\nTrample', 'Trample\\nWhen Crested Herdcaller enters the battlefield, create a 3/3 green Dinosaur creature token with trample.', 'Trample\\nWhen Earthshaker Giant enters the battlefield, other creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'Untap all nonland permanents you control.', 'Untap target creature. It gets +2/+4 and gains reach until end of turn. (It can block creatures with flying.)', "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\\nRenown 1 (When this creature deals combat damage to a player, if it isn't renowned, put a +1/+1 counter on it and it becomes renowned.)", 'Vigilance\\nWhen Highcliff Felidar enters the battlefield, for each opponent, choose a creature with the greatest power among creatures that player controls. Destroy those creatures.', 'When Relief Captain enters the battlefield, support 3. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to three other target creatures.)', 'When Salvager of Secrets enters the battlefield, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Tattered Mummy dies, each opponent loses 2 life.', 'Whenever Fiend Binder attacks, tap target creature defending player controls.', 'Whenever Howling Golem attacks or blocks, each player draws a card.', 'Whenever another creature you control dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Gavony Unhallowed.', "Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\nWhen Liliana's Mastery enters the battlefield, create two 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.", '{1}{B}: Target attacking Zombie gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it. If its toughness is 0 or less, it\'s still put into its owner\'s graveyard.)', '{4}{R}: Zealot of the God-Pharaoh deals 2 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.']
flavor: ['"Bant\'s most gallant knights wear my sigil, and for that I am humbled."', '"Come, my wild children. Let\'s give the interlopers a woodland welcome."', '"Dear brother, it\'s sweet that you have chosen to share your toys with Ludevic, but I too have found some new playmates."\\n—Ghoulcaller Gisa', '"Death is no excuse for disobedience."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Eyes see only what is possible. A trained mind can explore the impossible."\\n—Kefnet, god of knowledge', '"I don\'t think they\'ll appreciate my . . . adjustments."\\n—Karavin, renegade saboteur', '"I feel the presence of the God-Pharaoh in the Second Sun, and I rise upon its rays."', '"I have yet to find my equal."', '"I welcome the use of even the foulest magic if it will rid us of the monstrosities that plague our world."\\n—Munda, ambush leader', '"I would be a fool if I taught you everything I know."', '"It appears that nature has risen against us."\\n—Captain Brinely Rage', '"My scars are my sigils. I will wear them with pride long after you\'re gone."', '"My skill sharpens with each beat of my wings."', '"Nobody asked you to butt in, Jace. But thanks."\\n—Chandra Nalaar', '"Nobody\'s seen the Lady of Videns for years. Poor dear, no companions at all in that old castle."\\n—Yonda of Gavony', '"Only those who give the dragons the respect they deserve may bear our title."', '"Our survival, like theirs, depends on our ability to work together."\\n—Huatli, to Tishana', '"The tides have begun to ignore the moon."\\n—Tamiyo\'s journal', '"There are so many of them. It seems they\'ve just been waiting for someone to serve."', '"We entered the church in search of solace, but it became clear we wouldn\'t find it there."\\n—Grete, Order of Saint Traft', '"We share a common enemy. Does that not make us friends?"', '"Your death will be a balm, your passing a welcome revision, and all will sigh with peace to know of your demise."', "Carefully following the thaumatic compass Bolas had given her, Vraska blundered straight into the River Heralds' trap.", 'Dragon birth lairs are littered with treasure to entice the young from their eggs.', "Fools believe that Kolaghan's brood follows lightning storms. The wise know that it is the other way around.", 'Half the size, double the mayhem.', 'It slithers through the senses, constricting consciousness and poisoning perceptions.', 'It wails of buried riches and the souls lost seeking them.', "It's not the size of the rock. It's how badly you want to lift it.", 'Kytheon and his irregulars worked outside the law to bring justice to the streets of Akros.', "Often found browsing on the upper canopies of Ixalan's jungles, whiptails are known to absently bat away anything foolish enough to interrupt their meal.", "Once the felidar has marked you as prey, there's no point in running.", 'Raptors are clever enough to tear away a hard metal shell to get at the tasty morsel inside.', 'She had not believed any shred of humanity remained in these writhing monsters until the twisted form of her partner appeared before her.', 'Six feet of earth muffled his cries.', 'Sometimes gestures of support are small. Sometimes not.', 'Strong wings make strong winds.', 'The Curse of Wandering leaves only hatred.', "The God-Pharaoh's most devoted took it upon themselves to follow his example.", 'The banished have come home to roost.', 'The dead who wander beyond the safety of the city crave only to spread their curse.', 'The earth walks, strongest of all.', 'The greatest treasure of the deep is an echo from above.', 'The herds follow as new growth arises.', 'The sky takes flight and the earth trembles.', 'They cover their territory like a tide of teeth and claws.', 'To wield lightning is to tame chaos.']
artist: ['Adam Paquette', 'Alex Konstad', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Antonio José Manzanedo', 'Chase Stone', 'Chris Rallis', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cliff Childs', 'Daarken', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Gaillet', 'Dimitar Marinski', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Florian de Gesincourt', 'Gabor Szikszai', 'Greg Opalinski', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Howard Lyon', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Ryman', 'Jason Rainville', 'Johan Grenier', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'John Severin Brassell', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Jung Park', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Kimonas Theodossiou', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Winters', 'Mike Bierek', 'Milivoj Ćeran', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Simon Dominic', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Argyle', 'Tianhua X', 'Titus Lunter', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Vincent Proce', 'Wayne Reynolds']
