original_text: ['As an additional cost to cast this spell, reveal a Dinosaur card from your hand or pay {1}.\\nSearch your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may sacrifice any number of creatures. This spell costs {2} less to cast for each creature sacrificed this way.\\nWhen Torgaar, Famine Incarnate enters the battlefield, up to one target player's life total becomes half their starting life total, rounded down.", "As long as you control a Dragon, Kargan Dragonrider has flying. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", 'B', "Choose one —\\n• Destroy target artifact.\\n• Creatures without flying can't block this turn.", 'Create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.', 'Defender (This creature can\'t attack.)\\nWhen Dragon Egg dies, create a 2/2 red Dragon creature token with flying and "{R}: This creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', 'Destroy target tapped creature.', "Enchant creature\\nWhen Claustrophobia enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Enrage — Whenever Ranging Raptors is dealt damage, you may search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle your library.', 'Enrage — Whenever Ripjaw Raptor is dealt damage, draw a card.', 'First strike\\nIf a source would deal damage to an opponent, it deals double that damage to that player instead.', "First strike\\nRenown 1 (When this creature deals combat damage to a player, if it isn't renowned, put a +1/+1 counter on it and it becomes renowned.)\\nWhenever Consul's Lieutenant attacks, if it's renowned, other attacking creatures you control get +1/+1 until end of turn.", 'Flying', 'Flying, double strike, vigilance, trample, indestructible', 'Flying\\nLandfall — Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, Akoum Hellkite deals 1 damage to any target. If that land is a Mountain, Akoum Hellkite deals 2 damage to that permanent or player instead.', "Flying\\nVigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\\n{1}{W}: Target creature with a +1/+1 counter on it gains flying and vigilance until end of turn.", 'Flying\\nWhen Crow of Dark Tidings enters the battlefield or dies, put the top two cards of your library into your graveyard.', 'Flying\\nWhen Patron of the Valiant enters the battlefield, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sparktongue Dragon enters the battlefield, you may pay {2}{R}. When you do, it deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sphinx of Enlightenment enters the battlefield, target opponent draws a card and you draw three cards.', 'Flying\\nWhenever another nontoken Dragon enters the battlefield under your control, create a 5/5 red Dragon creature token with flying.\\n{1}{R}: Dragons you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Aven Wind Mage gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'G', "Haste\\nWhen Voldaren Duelist enters the battlefield, target creature can't block this turn.", 'Lightning Strike deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Menace\\nWhenever a creature attacks one of your opponents, that player loses 1 life.', 'Other Dinosaurs you control get +1/+1.\\n{5}{G}: Create a 3/3 green Dinosaur creature token with trample.', "Other Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: All Zombies gain menace until end of turn. (They can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. That creature is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types.', 'R', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', "Renown 1 (When this creature deals combat damage to a player, if it isn't renowned, put a +1/+1 counter on it and it becomes renowned.)\\n{W}{W}: Tap target creature.", "Return all nonland permanents target player controls to their owner's hand.", "Return target tapped creature to its owner's hand.\\nDraw a card.", "Return to their owners' hands all creatures with toughness less than or equal to the number of Islands you control.", "Tap up to two target creatures. Those creatures don't untap during their controller's next untap step.", 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', "Target creature gets +3/+1 and gains trample until end of turn. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", 'Target creature gets -4/-4 until end of turn.', 'This spell costs {1} less to cast for each instant and sorcery card in your graveyard.', 'This spell costs {X} less to cast, where X is the total power of creatures you control.\\nTrample', 'Trample\\nWhen Crested Herdcaller enters the battlefield, create a 3/3 green Dinosaur creature token with trample.', 'Trample\\nWhen Earthshaker Giant enters the battlefield, other creatures you control get +3/+3 and gain trample until end of turn.', 'U', 'Untap all nonland permanents you control.', 'Untap target creature. It gets +2/+4 and gains reach until end of turn. (It can block creatures with flying.)', "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\\nRenown 1 (When this creature deals combat damage to a player, if it isn't renowned, put a +1/+1 counter on it and it becomes renowned.)", 'Vigilance\\nWhen Highcliff Felidar enters the battlefield, for each opponent, choose a creature with the greatest power among creatures that player controls. Destroy those creatures.', 'W', 'When Relief Captain enters the battlefield, support 3. (Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to three other target creatures.)', 'When Salvager of Secrets enters the battlefield, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Tattered Mummy dies, each opponent loses 2 life.', 'Whenever Fiend Binder attacks, tap target creature defending player controls.', 'Whenever Howling Golem attacks or blocks, each player draws a card.', 'Whenever another creature you control dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Gavony Unhallowed.', "Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\nWhen Liliana's Mastery enters the battlefield, create two 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.", '{1}{B}: Target attacking Zombie gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it. If its toughness is 0 or less, it\'s still put into its owner\'s graveyard.)', '{4}{R}: Zealot of the God-Pharaoh deals 2 damage to target opponent or planeswalker.']
